    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Market Simulator</i> \u2014 a deeply immersive, first-person retail management experience where your journey from a modest shop owner to a thriving market tycoon begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a strategic thinker, an interior design enthusiast, or just love the satisfying rhythm of retail, <i>Market Simulator</i> puts you in complete control of every detail behind running your very own supermarket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfea Build the Store of Your Dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a blank space and transform it into a fully operational, customer-friendly marketplace. Design your layout with efficiency and style in mind \u2014 from shelving units and fridges to product displays and checkout counters. Optimize for flow, aesthetics, and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/9bb0fdc6af7e40382d34bb6eaaec13bc.poster.avif?t=1747176785\" width=648 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/9bb0fdc6af7e40382d34bb6eaaec13bc.webm?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/9bb0fdc6af7e40382d34bb6eaaec13bc.mp4?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Stock Smart, Sell Smarter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your in-game computer to browse a dynamic market system and order stock at the best prices. Receive deliveries, unpack goods, sort them in your storage area, and place them thoughtfully throughout your store. Be strategic \u2014 timing and selection can make or break your margins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb3 Master the Checkout Counter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Man the register yourself: scan items, handle payments, and make sure customers leave with a smile. Accept both cash and credit, bag groceries with care, and keep the lines moving smoothly for peak efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/ac99319fe499c75611ed26a60736a1e8.poster.avif?t=1747176785\" width=648 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/ac99319fe499c75611ed26a60736a1e8.webm?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/ac99319fe499c75611ed26a60736a1e8.mp4?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Play the Market</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track product trends, buy low, and sell high. Adjust your prices to attract more customers or maximize profit. Monitor customer satisfaction and demand \u2014 the better your service and pricing, the stronger your reputation becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/b488a45801fc155ba46ee027e7f84811.poster.avif?t=1747176785\" width=646 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/b488a45801fc155ba46ee027e7f84811.webm?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/b488a45801fc155ba46ee027e7f84811.mp4?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 Expand, Upgrade, Dominate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your hard-earned profits to expand your floor space, renovate your store, and upgrade equipment. Adapt to the evolving needs of your growing customer base and stay ahead in a competitive retail world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Market Simulator</i>, every decision matters.</strong><br>Will you build a local shopping haven or a retail empire? The market is waiting.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Market Simulator</i> \u2014 a deeply immersive, first-person retail management experience where your journey from a modest shop owner to a thriving market tycoon begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a strategic thinker, an interior design enthusiast, or just love the satisfying rhythm of retail, <i>Market Simulator</i> puts you in complete control of every detail behind running your very own supermarket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfea Build the Store of Your Dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a blank space and transform it into a fully operational, customer-friendly marketplace. Design your layout with efficiency and style in mind \u2014 from shelving units and fridges to product displays and checkout counters. Optimize for flow, aesthetics, and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/9bb0fdc6af7e40382d34bb6eaaec13bc.poster.avif?t=1747176785\" width=648 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/9bb0fdc6af7e40382d34bb6eaaec13bc.webm?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/9bb0fdc6af7e40382d34bb6eaaec13bc.mp4?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Stock Smart, Sell Smarter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your in-game computer to browse a dynamic market system and order stock at the best prices. Receive deliveries, unpack goods, sort them in your storage area, and place them thoughtfully throughout your store. Be strategic \u2014 timing and selection can make or break your margins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb3 Master the Checkout Counter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Man the register yourself: scan items, handle payments, and make sure customers leave with a smile. Accept both cash and credit, bag groceries with care, and keep the lines moving smoothly for peak efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/ac99319fe499c75611ed26a60736a1e8.poster.avif?t=1747176785\" width=648 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/ac99319fe499c75611ed26a60736a1e8.webm?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/ac99319fe499c75611ed26a60736a1e8.mp4?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Play the Market</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track product trends, buy low, and sell high. Adjust your prices to attract more customers or maximize profit. Monitor customer satisfaction and demand \u2014 the better your service and pricing, the stronger your reputation becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/b488a45801fc155ba46ee027e7f84811.poster.avif?t=1747176785\" width=646 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/b488a45801fc155ba46ee027e7f84811.webm?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579920/extras/b488a45801fc155ba46ee027e7f84811.mp4?t=1747176785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 Expand, Upgrade, Dominate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your hard-earned profits to expand your floor space, renovate your store, and upgrade equipment. Adapt to the evolving needs of your growing customer base and stay ahead in a competitive retail world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Market Simulator</i>, every decision matters.</strong><br>Will you build a local shopping haven or a retail empire? The market is waiting.</p>",
